@startuml getOperationKeyAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getOperationKeyAsync – Retrieve Operation Key
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "Operation Client Interface" as oci #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - operationClientUuid
end note

requestor -> oci: (operationClientUuid)
activate oci

oci -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> oci: Operation Client LTP List
deactivate jd

note over oci
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Locate OP client interface with matching operationClientUuid  
  - Read operation-key attribute  
  - Return operationKey if found  
  - Return undefined if no match exists
end note

oci --> requestor: operationKey | undefined
deactivate oci

@enduml
